              "id": "1763421601419_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Given this data:\n {{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_DATA.$output.result}}\n\nProduce one communication suggestion with the following:\ntitle: Send Financial Report\ndescription: one sentence on what you would send (summary)\nactionText: Send\nInclude the following information in the communication content\n      executiveSummary: A three sentence summary of overall financial health\n      expensesUpdate: What changed in expenses and why\n      incomeUpdate: What changed in income and why\nGenerate the email content using rich text with html markers\n\nAlso generate a text communication for ways to save money in the next quarter.\n- add an editable parameter which estimates the cost that can be saved.\n- add a non editable parameter which indicates the person who suggested this option as John Club.\nSet the targetAgent for this communication as CHARLIE_DEALS_ADVISOR"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
